{"unit_id":"tag:095A:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为态射（morphism），其两端为概形（schemes）。若<MATH_0002>为局部常值（locally constant）层（sheaf），其值为集合（sets）、阿贝尔群（abelian groups）或<MATH_0003>-模（modules），定义于<MATH_0004>上，则同样的性质对<MATH_0005>在<MATH_0006>上成立。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"locally constant","target_term":"局部常值"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"abelian groups","target_term":"阿贝尔群"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"locally constant","target_term":"局部常值","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"abelian groups","target_term":"阿贝尔群","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"暂译。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:095A:proof","translation":"对任意拓扑斯态射（morphism of topoi）均成立，见位点上的模（Modules on Sites），引理<REF_0001>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"morphism of topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯态射"},{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"位点上的模"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"morphism of topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯态射","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"位点上的模","context":"暂译。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:095B:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为有限（finite）平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）态射（morphism），其两端为概形（schemes）。若<MATH_0002>为（有限（finite））局部常值（locally constant）层（sheaf），其值为集合（sets），或（有限（finite））局部常值（locally constant）层（sheaf），其值为阿贝尔群（abelian groups），或（有限型（finite type））局部常值（locally constant）层（sheaf），其值为<MATH_0003>-模（modules），定义于<MATH_0004>上，则同样的性质对<MATH_0005>在<MATH_0006>上成立。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"locally constant","target_term":"局部常值"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"locally constant","target_term":"局部常值"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"abelian groups","target_term":"阿贝尔群"},{"source_term":"finite type","target_term":"有限型"},{"source_term":"locally constant","target_term":"局部常值"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"locally constant","target_term":"局部常值","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"abelian groups","target_term":"阿贝尔群","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"finite type","target_term":"有限型","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"暂译。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:095B:proof","translation":"构造<MATH_0001>与平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）局部化（localization）可交换（commutes）。有限（finite）平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）态射（morphism）局部同构（isomorphic）于不交并（disjoint union），由同构（isomorphisms）组成，见平展（<ACCENT_0003>tale）态射（Morphisms），引理<REF_0001>。因此引理是说，若<MATH_0002>、<MATH_0003>为（有限（finite））局部常值（locally constant）层（sheaves），其值为集合（sets），则<MATH_0004>也是。这是清楚的。对于层（sheaves），其值为阿贝尔群（abelian groups）和模（modules），也类似。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"localization","target_term":"局部化"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"可交换"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"disjoint union","target_term":"不交并"},{"source_term":"isomorphisms","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0003>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"locally constant","target_term":"局部常值"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"abelian groups","target_term":"阿贝尔群"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"localization","target_term":"局部化","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"可交换","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"disjoint union","target_term":"不交并","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"isomorphisms","target_term":"同构","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0003>tale","target_te